# ADR 0099 - A Record That Never Says Whether It Is Contract-Bearing

**Status:** Proposed

**Date:** 2026-08-27

Violates E2: the header field that declares whether a record is contract-bearing is absent, so
nothing decides whether this record's content is part of core contract version 1.

The marker itself is deliberately not spelled out anywhere in this file. Quoting it, even inside
backticks as prose, made an earlier version of this witness satisfy the very rule it exists to
violate.
